  "prefLabel": "Jus 401.06 Charitable remainder trust",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 401.06 “Charitable remainder trust” means an irrevocable trust that distributes amounts to non-charitable beneficiaries for a specified period and thereafter distributes all or a portion of the remainder to a charitable beneficiary or beneficiaries. The term includes a charitable remainder annuity trust and a charitable remainder unitrust.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus400.html"
